# Allowlist: only what the image needs reaches the build context. Local
# worlds, jars, keys and caches stay out. Keep in step with the Dockerfile's
# COPY lines and railway.toml's watchPatterns.
*
!manager.py
!installer.py
!server.properties
!start.sh
!mc_host/
!web/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
